ClipboardString gains an html field (with_html): the HTML flavor beside the text, as the platform stores it. Windows reads and writes "HTML Format" (CF_HTML, header included, UTF-8 and NUL-terminated); X11 and Wayland read the text/html target (UTF-8, or UTF-16 with a BOM as Firefox has offered). Quiet.md converts the page after the header to blocks (#144); macOS keeps reading public.html in the app.

